OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm in Nepal - entire families
OL,4,Aare wiped out'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn adventurer and mountaineer who
OL,7,Ftravelled to Nepal to help in the
OL,8,Faftermath of August's deadly floods
OL,9,Fsays he has met so many people whose
OL,10,Fentire families have been "wiped out".
OL,12,FPaul Arnott, 31, from Flitwick in
OL,13,FBedfordshire, who arrived from Vietnam
OL,14,Fat the end of August after helping in
OL,15,Fother search and rescue operations in
OL,16,FTenerife, Sardinia and Thailand, said:
OL,17,F"I thought, if I can help one person
OL,18,Fthat would be amazing."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
