OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm in Nepal - entire families
OL,4,Aare wiped out'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said after being stuck in Kathmandu
OL,7,Ffor about three days he finally made it
OL,8,Fto Trishuli at the beginning of
OL,9,FSeptember.
OL,11,F"It was awful, it looked like a war
OL,12,Fscene, all the buildings were destroyed
OL,13,Fand the buildings that were still
OL,14,Fstanding were covered in mud."
